# Ownership split (pattern from akuity/akp-platform): platform-owned paths need
# platform review. App manifests (apps/*/base, apps/*/env) are deliberately not
# listed; app teams own their deployment config. That split is part of the
# story: the culprit commit went through the platform path, which had no gate.
#
# hack/personalize.sh rewrites the owner below for your fork.

/bootstrap/          @dhpup
/kargo-shared/       @dhpup
/apps/*/argocd/      @dhpup
/apps/*/kargo/       @dhpup
/hack/               @dhpup
/versions.env        @dhpup
/.github/            @dhpup
